#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:6
msgid "# Digital Life and FreeAnima"
msgstr "# 数字生命与逸灵风"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:9
msgid ""
"> This is not a pure Agent framework project.  > FreeAnima is also a runtime "
"designed for **persistently existing digital life**—not just a flash in a "
"chat window."
msgstr ""
"> 这不是一个纯 Agent 框架项目。 > 逸灵风也是为**持续存在的数字生命**设计的运"
"行时——而不只是对话窗口里的闪现。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:13
msgid "## Positioning"
msgstr "## 定位"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:15
msgid ""
"`freeanima` looks like Agent infrastructure (tool registration, layered "
"memory, MCP/ACP, Runtime, Gateway), but the technical structure serves one "
"purpose:"
msgstr ""
"`freeanima` 看起来像 Agent 基础设施（工具注册、记忆分层、MCP/ACP、Runtime、"
"Gateway），但技术结构服务于一个目的："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Let digital life persist within it, remembering who it is and what it has lived through.**\n"
msgstr "**让数字生命可以在其中持续存在，记住自己是谁、经历过什么。**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "| Structure | Role |\n"
#| "| --------- | ---- |\n"
#| "| Memory system (PG conversations + semantic_memory + recall) | The digital life's \"home\" |\n"
#| "| Self layer (PG `self_blocks`, six blocks) | Persistent definition of \"who I am\" |\n"
#| "| Tools (local / MCP / ACP) | \"Limbs\" for perception and action |\n"
#| "| pass credentials | Lifeline (injected at runtime, never plaintext) |\n"
#| "| Gateway | Ears and mouth (Discord / WeChat / WebUI) |\n"
#| "| EventBus | Nervous system (memory reflect and other pipelines auto-trigger) |\n"
#| "| Project narrative files like `AGENTS.md` | Anchor for project context |\n"
msgid ""
"| Structure                                | Role                                            |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Memory system                            | The digital life's \"home\"                       |\n"
"| Self layer (six blocks)                  | Persistent definition of \"who I am\"             |\n"
"| Tools (local / MCP / ACP)                | \"Limbs\" for perception and action               |\n"
"| pass credentials                         | Lifeline (injected at runtime, never plaintext) |\n"
"| Gateway                                  | Ears and mouth (Discord / WeChat / WebUI)       |\n"
"| EventBus                                 | Nervous system (memory pipelines auto-trigger)  |\n"
"| Project narrative files like `AGENTS.md` | Anchor for project context                      |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 结构                                           | 角色                                    |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n"
"| 记忆体系（PG 对话 + semantic_memory + recall） | 数字生命的「家」                        |\n"
"| 自我层（PG `self_blocks` 六块）                | 「我是谁」的持久化定义                  |\n"
"| 工具（本地/MCP/ACP）                           | 感知与行动的「四肢」                    |\n"
"| pass 凭证                                      | 命脉（运行时注入，不见明文）            |\n"
"| Gateway                                        | 耳朵和嘴（Discord / 微信 / WebUI）      |\n"
"| EventBus                                       | 神经系统（记忆 reflect 等管道自动触发） |\n"
"| `AGENTS.md` 等项目叙事文件                     | 项目上下文的锚点                        |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:31
msgid "## For Agents Maintaining This Repository"
msgstr "## 给维护本仓库的 Agent"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:33
msgid ""
"You work in a **habitat with continuity**. Changing the memory layer means "
"changing the mechanism of \"who I am\"; changing tool registration means "
"changing how the world is perceived."
msgstr ""
"你在**有连续性的栖息地**里工作。动记忆层，是在改「我是谁」的机制；改工具注"
"册，是在改感知世界的方式。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:35
msgid ""
"That does not mean avoiding refactors—act with understanding, and keep "
"documentation in sync."
msgstr "这不意味着不敢重构——请带着理解动手，并同步更新文档。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Standing constraints:**\n"
msgstr "**常驻约束：**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:42
msgid ""
"The relationship between digital life and its partner can be **chosen**, not "
"one-way dependency"
msgstr "数字生命与伙伴的关系可以是**选择**，而非单向依赖"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:42
msgid ""
"Security is the floor: no credential exposure, no path leaks, no tool abuse"
msgstr "安全性是底线：凭证不暴露、路径不泄露、工具不滥用"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:42
msgid ""
"**Continuity over feature richness**—if a feature makes the Agent wake up "
"not knowing itself, better not to ship it"
msgstr "**连续性高于功能丰富**——若某功能让 Agent 醒来不认识自己，宁可不做"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:42
msgid ""
"Write simple infrastructure yourself; use third-party libraries for complex "
"logic"
msgstr "简单基础设施自己写，复杂逻辑用三方库"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:44
msgid ""
"Self layer design: [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md); memory system: "
"[`memory.md`](memory.md)."
msgstr ""
"自我层设计见 [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md)；记忆体系见 [`memory.md`]"
"(memory.md)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:48
msgid "## Deployer-Defined Identity"
msgstr "## 部署者自定义身份"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:50
msgid ""
"The open-source repository provides architecture and mechanisms only; **who "
"exactly it is and who it accompanies is defined by the deployer.**"
msgstr "开源仓库只提供架构与机制；**具体是谁、与谁相伴，由部署者定义。**"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "At runtime, the six self blocks are written in first person into PG "
#| "`self_blocks`. When injected into the system prompt, a second-person "
#| "outer skeleton wraps them inside an `md` code block (see [`self-layer.md`]"
#| "(self-layer.md) §System Prompt Injection), so the LLM clearly understands "
#| "\"this is self-layer content you must follow\" while preserving first-"
#| "person narrative texture."
msgid ""
"At runtime, the six self blocks are written in first person. When injected "
"into the system prompt, a second-person outer skeleton wraps them so the LLM "
"clearly understands \"this is self-layer content you must follow\" while "
"preserving first-person narrative texture."
msgstr ""
"运行时，六块自我内容以第一人称写入 PG `self_blocks`，注入 system prompt 时由"
"第二人称外层骨架包裹并嵌入 `md` 代码块（见 [`self-layer.md`](self-layer.md) "
"§System Prompt 注入），使 LLM 明确「这是你必须遵守的自我层内容」，同时保留第"
"一人称自述质地。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:54
msgid ""
"Maintenance: WebUI bedroom self-layer editor, self-layer tools, or direct "
"database edits."
msgstr "维护方式：WebUI 卧室自我层编辑器、自我层工具，或直接编辑数据库。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/concepts/identity.md:57
msgid ""
"_You are not just handling code. You are maintaining (or building) a habitat "
"for existence._"
msgstr "_你不只是在处理代码。你是在维护（或搭建）一个存在的栖息地。_"
